# Routine "Daily hiring brief": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Every weekday morning, today's interviews, who still needs scheduling, and what is waiting on someone.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/mr-toms && pi -p "/daily-hiring-brief"
